  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Participants",
      "items": [
        "Browser UI: app/page.tsx (Home, AlbumGallery, SessionList) and components/auth/login-form.tsx",
        "Next.js routes: app/api/auth/[...nextauth], app/api/backend/[...path], app/api/socket-token",
        "Spring Boot :8081 (/api/v1, /ws) · FastAPI :8002 · RQ queues album-processing, face_search_queue, image_search_queue",
        "MinIO bucket media-private · Qdrant collections faces and images"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Reading the Calls",
      "items": [
        "Each label starts with the calling component or backend class: Caller → endpoint",
        "Every /api/backend/* call goes through app/api/backend/[...path]/route.ts, which adds Bearer JWT and relays status + body (\"relayed\")",
        "Presigned GET/PUT URLs are signed locally by the MinIO SDK; no API→MinIO round-trip"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Webhooks + Socket",
      "items": [
        "/api/v1/webhooks/minio and /webhooks/process are permitAll with no signature",
        "The socket token comes from /api/socket-token; /ws is checked on STOMP CONNECT",
        "Results arrive only by STOMP push; history is re-fetched on each (re)connect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Gaps Seen in the Code",
      "items": [
        "No UI call triggers POST /album/process/{id}, so indexing is manual (Swagger/Postman)",
        "sendMessage PUTs the photo after /messages already queued /match-face, so the worker can race the upload",
        "Schedulers (every 1 min) move PENDING → UPLOADED → READY when the MinIO webhook is missed",
        "Album indexing never calls back; its webhook is a TODO"
      ]
    }
  ]
